      "file": "chalk-billiards.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 27,
      "zh": "在白球附近按下并向后拖拽，松手出杆。每桌连续完成三个固定球型；目标球必须进入发光袋口，力度落在标记区且无白球/干扰球落袋，才获得第三星。",
      "en": "Press near the cue ball, drag back and release to shoot. Clear three fixed shots on each table; the target ball must enter the glowing pocket, power must land in the marked zone, and no cue or blocker ball may be potted to earn the third star."
    },
